---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Curriculum Vitae | Tanishk Tiwari" 
  description="Curriculum Vitae of Tanishk Tiwari. Undergraduate AI & ML researcher at Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University with peer-reviewed publications in computational epigraphy and LLM inference optimization."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <!-- Header Page Actions -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-brand-border/40 pb-6 no-print">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-slate font-lora">Curriculum Vitae</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mt-1">Print-ready academic resume.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <button 
          onclick="window.print()" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-brand-slate text-brand-slate hover:bg-brand-sand/40 font-semibold rounded shadow-sm transition-all duration-150 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide cursor-pointer focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-rust"
        >
          Print CV
        </button>
        <a 
          href="/cv/CV_TanT.pdf" 
          download
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 bg-brand-rust text-white hover:bg-brand-rust-hover font-semibold rounded shadow transition-all duration-150 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-rust"
        >
          Download PDF
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CV Sheet Container -->
    <article class="bg-white border border-brand-border/25 rounded p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm font-sans text-stone-800 space-y-8 print:border-none print:p-0 print:shadow-none">
      <!-- CV Header -->
      <header class="text-center space-y-2 border-b border-brand-border/40 pb-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-lora text-brand-slate tracking-tight">Tanishk Tiwari</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 font-medium font-lora">Undergraduate Researcher in NLP and Efficient LLM Inference</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-brand-muted font-semibold">
          <a href="mailto:t.high1945@gmail.com" class="hover:underline hover:text-brand-rust">t.high1945@gmail.com</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/horus84" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline hover:text-brand-rust">github.com/horus84</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>New Delhi, India</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Education Section -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-rust border-b border-brand-border/20 pb-1">Education</h3>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start text-sm">
            <div>
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate block">Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-stone-600 italic block">B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <span class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-semibold block">New Delhi, India</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-brand-rust font-semibold block">Expected 2028</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-stone-600 space-y-1.5">
            <li>CGPA: <strong class="text-brand-slate">8.2/10</strong></li>
            <li>Relevant Coursework: Probability and Statistics, Optimization, Data Structures and Algorithms, Machine Learning, and Discrete Mathematics.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Research Experience -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-rust border-b border-brand-border/20 pb-1">Research Experience</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-5 text-xs">
          <!-- Research 1 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start text-sm">
              <div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate block">Efficient LLM Inference and KV-Cache Compression</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic block">Independent Researcher</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-semibold block">Remote</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-rust font-semibold block">2026 – Present</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-stone-600 space-y-1.5">
              <li>Developing a value-focused KV-cache compression framework for reducing memory use during long-context autoregressive inference.</li>
              <li>Investigating adaptive low-rank representations, salient residual preservation, and compressed attention computation using PyTorch and Hugging Face Transformers.</li>
              <li>Designing evaluations covering model quality, memory usage, latency, throughput, perplexity, and long-context task performance.</li>
              <li>Preparing the work for submission through ACL Rolling Review.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Research 2 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start text-sm">
              <div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate block">Computational Analysis of Indus Sign Sequences</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic block">Independent Undergraduate Researcher</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-semibold block">New Delhi, India</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-rust font-semibold block">2025 – 2026</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-stone-600 space-y-1.5">
              <li>Built and harmonized a corpus of more than 6,000 Indus inscriptions for statistical and neural sequence analysis.</li>
              <li>Studied conditional entropy, PMI, positional regularity, directional asymmetry, HMM structure, and BiLSTM next-token prediction.</li>
              <li>Designed sequence-reversal and perturbation experiments to test whether observed ordering constraints could be explained by chance or simple frequency effects.</li>
              <li>Published and presented the resulting work at NLP4DH 2026, co-located with ACL 2026, in San Diego.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Research 3 -->
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start text-sm">
              <div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate block">Quantum Machine Learning and Circuit Trainability</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-stone-500 italic block">Independent Researcher</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right">
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-muted font-semibold block">Remote</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-brand-rust font-semibold block">2026 – Present</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-stone-600 space-y-1.5">
              <li>Built mixed-state PyTorch and PennyLane experiments using amplitude damping and non-unitary operations.</li>
              <li>Measured gradient variance across circuit depths and noise settings to study parameterized quantum-circuit trainability and barren-plateau behaviour.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Publications and Presentations -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-rust border-b border-brand-border/20 pb-1">Publications & Presentations</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
          <!-- Pub 1 -->
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate text-sm">Statistical Structure in Indus Sign Sequences</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2026</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600">
              <strong>Tiwari, T.</strong> <span class="italic text-stone-500">Proceedings of NLP4DH 2026</span>, co-located with ACL 2026. Presented in person in San Diego, USA. 
              [<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.nlp4dh-1.28/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-rust hover:underline">ACL Anthology</a>]
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pub 2 -->
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate text-sm">An Empirical Refutation of Yajnadevam’s Devanagari-Based Decipherment of the Indus Script</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2025</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600">
              <strong>Tiwari, T.</strong> Independent research article. 
              [<a href="https://www.academia.edu/129821471/Empirical_Refutation_of_Yajnadevams_Devanagari_Based_Decipherment_of_the_Indus_Script" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-rust hover:underline">Article</a>]
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Talk 1 -->
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate text-sm">Reading the Indus Anew</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2025</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600">
              Invited research lecture delivered at the Roja Muthiah Research Library, Chennai, India.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Selected Recognition -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-rust border-b border-brand-border/20 pb-1">Selected Recognition</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-600">
          <div class="space-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Peer-Reviewed International Research Presentation</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2026</span>
            </div>
            <p>Presented “Statistical Structure in Indus Sign Sequences” at NLP4DH 2026, co-located with ACL 2026, in San Diego, USA.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">EACL Student Research Workshop Mentorship</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2026</span>
            </div>
            <p>Selected for the EACL 2026 Student Research Workshop pre-submission mentorship programme.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-0.5">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <span class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Invited Research Lecture</span>
              <span class="text-brand-muted font-medium">2025</span>
            </div>
            <p>Invited to present “Reading the Indus Anew” at the Roja Muthiah Research Library in Chennai.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Skills Section -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-rust border-b border-brand-border/20 pb-1">Technical Skills</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 text-xs text-stone-600">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Programming</p>
            <p>Python, C++</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Machine Learning / NLP</p>
            <p>PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, scikit-learn, XGBoost</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Scientific Computing</p>
            <p>NumPy, pandas, SciPy, Optuna</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Tools</p>
            <p>Git, Linux, LaTeX, Streamlit, PennyLane</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:col-span-2 space-y-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-slate">Research Areas</p>
            <p>Efficient LLM inference, KV-cache compression, sequence modelling, statistical NLP, and low-resource language processing</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
